      {
        "dom_id": "question-165768",
        "name": "Question 12",
        "problem": "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $t(x)={x}^{4}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡{x}^{3}.$",
        "worked_solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={x}^{4}$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡{x}^{3}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{4})^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{tanh}⁡{x}^{3}+{x}^{4}\\cdot (\\operatorname{tanh}⁡{x}^{3})^{′} \\\\  & =4{x}^{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{tanh}⁡{x}^{3}+{x}^{4}\\cdot 3{x}^{2}{sech}^{2}⁡{x}^{3} \\\\  & =4{x}^{3}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡{x}^{3}+3{x}^{6}{sech}^{2}⁡{x}^{3} \\\\  & ={x}^{3}(4\\operatorname{tanh}⁡{x}^{3}+3{x}^{3}{sech}^{2}⁡{x}^{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "answer_fields_complete": true,
        "result": "Incorrect",
        "html": "<div id=\"question-165768\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">12.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"165768\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"75\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Find the derivative of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"76\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-