      {
        "dom_id": "question-165769",
        "name": "Question 15",
        "problem": "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x)={e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡{x}^{4}.$",
        "worked_solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={e}^{3x}$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡{x}^{4}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =({e}^{3x})^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{sinh}⁡{x}^{4}+{e}^{3x}\\cdot (\\operatorname{sinh}⁡{x}^{4})^{′} \\\\  & =3{e}^{3x}\\cdot \\operatorname{sinh}⁡{x}^{4}+{e}^{3x}\\cdot 4{x}^{3}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡{x}^{4} \\\\  & =3{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡{x}^{4}+4{x}^{3}{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡{x}^{4} \\\\  & ={e}^{3x}(3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡{x}^{4}+4{x}^{3}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡{x}^{4})\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "answer_fields_complete": true,
        "result": "Correct",
        "html": "<div id=\"question-165769\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">15.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"165769\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"92\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Find the derivative of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"93\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" s