            "source_sha256": "b19f1438aef49b920c9fdce5553b478084d7c65febee808232617d1ed236089d",
            "source_file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/browser-originals/b19f1438aef49b920c9fdce5553b478084d7c65febee808232617d1ed236089d.html",
            "status": 200,
            "headers": {
              "date": "Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:57:20 GMT",
              "etag": "W/\"38eb7-MN3bYvIqsP0Dq2MunUz5Q4qnwCs\""
            },
            "transformation": null,
            "rendered_sha256": "b19f1438aef49b920c9fdce5553b478084d7c65febee808232617d1ed236089d"
          }
        ],
        "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199233/observations/step-e8332-36860b8c72eb7f6f566f.html",
        "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199233/observations/step-e8332-36860b8c72eb7f6f566f.png",
        "worked_solution": "First, we express $f(x)$ as a composite function:\n\n$$\nf = \\cosh g, \\qquad g = \\sqrt x\n$$\n\nThe chain rule states that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}x} = \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g} \\cdot \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g}  = \\sinh g,\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x} = \\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt x}.\n$$\n\nFinally, multiplying the two results together and substituting for $g$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{sinh}⁡g\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{x}}{2\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "can_dont_know": false,
        "can_skip": false,
        "question": {
          "dom_id": "step-e8332",
          "name": "Example: Differentiating Hyperbolic Functions Using the Chain Rule",
          "problem": "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x) = \\cosh{\\sqrt x}.$",
          "worked_solution": "First, we express $f(x)$ as a composite function:\n\n$$\nf = \\cosh g, \\qquad g = \\sqrt x\n$$\n\nThe chain rule states that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}x} = \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g} \\cdot \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g}  = \\sinh g,\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x} = \\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt x}.\n$$\n\nFinally, multiplying the two results together and substituting for $g$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{sinh}⁡g\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{x}}{2\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
          "fields": [],
          "problem_field_keys": [],
          "answer_fields_complete": null,
          "result": null,
          "proof_feedback": null,
          "html": "<div id=\"step-e8332\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Differentiating Hyperbolic Functions Using the Chain Rule</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e8332\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\