        "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199233/observations/step-q95234-a22b435eea96f3f9e3bd.html",
        "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199233/observations/step-q95234-a22b435eea96f3f9e3bd.png",
        "worked_solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={x}^{2}$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{2})^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+{x}^{2}\\cdot (\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)^{′} \\\\  & =2x\\cdot \\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+{x}^{2}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+2{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x \\\\  & =2x(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "can_dont_know": false,
        "can_skip": false,
        "question": {
          "dom_id": "step-q95234",
          "name": "Question 14",
          "problem": "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x)={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x.$",
          "worked_solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={x}^{2}$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{2})^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+{x}^{2}\\cdot (\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)^{′} \\\\  & =2x\\cdot \\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+{x}^{2}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+2{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x \\\\  & =2x(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
          "fields": [
            {
              "key": "selection",
              "type": "radio",
              "choices": [
                {
                  "option": "a",
                  "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95234-a",
                  "type": "math",
                  "value": "2x(x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)",
                  "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"155\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cosh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>sinh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
                },
                {
                  "option": "b",
                  "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95234-b",
