        ],
        "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199233/observations/step-q95326-019940214da4fea58b9c.html",
        "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199233/observations/step-q95326-019940214da4fea58b9c.png",
        "worked_solution": "In this case, the expression for $t(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x$ and $v(x)={e}^{x}.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{t}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)^{′}\\cdot {e}^{x}-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\cdot ({e}^{x})^{′}}{({e}^{x})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{{e}^{2x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)}{{e}^{2x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "can_dont_know": false,
        "can_skip": false,
        "question": {
          "dom_id": "step-q95326",
          "name": "Question 16",
          "problem": "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $t(x)=\\frac{\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}.$",
          "worked_solution": "In this case, the expression for $t(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x$ and $v(x)={e}^{x}.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{t}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)^{′}\\cdot {e}^{x}-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\cdot ({e}^{x})^{′}}{({e}^{x})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{{e}^{2x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)}{{e}^{2x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
          "fields": [
            {
              "key": "selection",
              "type": "radio",
