and{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\"></defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\"></g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>We would like the prove the following result:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"5.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.005ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1508.9 9377.3 2372\" width=\"21.78ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\tanh{x}) = \\sech^2{x}\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-64\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q17