        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "Using the sum and constant multiple rules, with (sinh x)' = cosh x and (cosh x)' = sinh x, the derivative is 2cosh x + 3sinh x, option e. No Math Academy answer or grade for this current question is captured; the supplied worked example establishes the derivative rules only.",
