      {
        "key": "step-q95670",
        "question": {
          "dom_id": "step-q95670",
          "name": "Question 3",
          "problem": "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $y=6\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x.$",
          "worked_solution": "First, we recall the results for the derivatives of the basic hyperbolic functions:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)={sech}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the given function using these results, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x) \\\\  & =6\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x) \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-{sech}^{2}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
