        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "Using (tanh x)' = sech² x and (sinh x)' = cosh x, the constant multiple and difference rules give y' = (1/2)sech² x − 4cosh x, option d. No Math Academy answer or grade for the current question is captured.",
