        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "Since f(x) = 4(sinh x)^3, the power and chain rules give f'(x) = 4·3(sinh x)^2·cosh x = 12sinh² x cosh x, option b. No Math Academy answer or grade for the current question is captured.",
          "confidence": 1,
          "answers": [
            {
              "key": "selection",
              "correct_value": "12{sinh}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x",
              "correct_option": "b",
              "value_type": "math",
