        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "Writing f(x) = [sinh(x³)]^{-1}, the chain rule gives f'(x) = −[sinh(x³)]^{-2}cosh(x³)·3x², matching option a for x ≠ 0. No Math Academy answer or grade for the current question is captured.",
