        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "The product and chain rules give t'(x) = 4x³tanh(x³) + x⁴sech²(x³)·3x² = x³[4tanh(x³) + 3x³sech²(x³)], matching option a. No Math Academy answer or grade for the current question is captured.",
