      {
        "key": "step-q95278",
        "question": {
          "dom_id": "step-q95278",
          "name": "Question 13",
          "problem": "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $w(x)={e}^{2x}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x.$",
          "worked_solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={e}^{2x}$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{w}^{′}(x) & =({e}^{2x})^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+{e}^{2x}\\cdot (\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x)^{′} \\\\  & =2{e}^{2x}\\cdot \\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+{e}^{2x}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x \\\\  & =2{e}^{2x}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+2{e}^{2x}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x \\\\  & =2{e}^{2x}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
          "fields": [
            {
              "key": "selection",
              "type": "radio",
              "choices": [
                {
                  "option": "a",
                  "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95278-a",
                  "type": "math",
                  "value": "4{e}^{2x}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x",
                  "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"145\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>cosh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
                },
                {
                  "option": "b",
                  "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95278-b",
