        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "The quotient rule gives t'(x) = [e^x sinh x − e^x cosh x]/e^{2x} = (sinh x − cosh x)/e^x, matching option d. No Math Academy answer or grade for the current question is captured.",
          "confidence": 1,
          "answers": [
            {
              "key": "selection",
              "correct_value": "\\frac{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}",
