        "solution": {
          "status": "ambiguous",
          "reasoning": "Since (tanh(2x))' = 2sech²(2x), the quotient rule gives w'(x) = e^x[tanh(2x) − 2sech²(2x)]/tanh²(2x). Thus g(x) matches option d. No Math Academy answer or grade for the current question is captured.",
